#: index.md:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the smallest package"
msgstr "Utilisez le package le plus petit"

#: index.md:28
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Install just <code>@pantoken/css</code> for a stylesheet, <code>@pantoken/"
"pendo</code> for guides, or a bundler preset for Tailwind, Panda, or MUI."
msgstr ""
"Installez seulement @pantoken/css pour une feuille de style, @pantoken/react "
"pour les hooks et icônes, ou un preset de bundler pour Tailwind, Panda ou "
"MUI."

#: index.md:32
#, no-c-format
msgid "Generate for any platform"
msgstr "Générez pour n'importe quelle plateforme"

#: index.md:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Install the pantoken cli to generate presets or add components for any "
"platform&colon; web, native, and anything in between."
msgstr ""

#: index.md:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "No React needed"
msgstr ""

#: index.md:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The InstUI library is tightly coupled with React. If you want to use it, you "
"have to use React. Now you can build anywhere."
msgstr ""

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "InstUI, everywhere"
#~ msgstr "InstUI, partout"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Every package reads the same resolved token IR. Change a token upstream "
#~ "and it flows to CSS, SCSS, native code, and Figma the same way."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Chaque package lit le même IR de tokens résolu. Changez un token en amont "
#~ "et il se propage de la même façon vers le CSS, SCSS, le code natif et "
#~ "Figma."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Run `pantoken generate` to emit Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, "
#~ "WordPress, and more. The same tokens, in each ecosystem's idiom."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Exécutez `pantoken generate` pour émettre Swift, Kotlin, Compose, "
#~ "Flutter, Rust, WordPress, et plus. Les mêmes tokens, dans l'idiome de "
#~ "chaque écosystème."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "No upstream coupling"
#~ msgstr "Pas de couplage en amont"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "The tokens ship vendored as static JSON, so `npm i` never reaches for a "
